Package: monitor-dhcp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: monitor-dhcp contributors
Depends: systemd (>= 245), passwd
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/arturormk/monitor-dhcp-rust
Description: deterministic DHCPv4 server for a dedicated Ethernet interface
 A small DHCPv4 server which gives configured addresses to known MAC
 addresses and one deterministic default address to unknown clients.
